{"id":"a514469c2cfe1502","group":"17","path":"17/17-df-simultaneous-substitution.md","title":"Simultaneous Structural Substitution and Capture-Freeness","display":"df-simultaneous-substitution — Simultaneous Structural Substitution and Capture-Freeness","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-df-simultaneous-substitution","aliases":["17-df-simultaneous-substitution"],"display":"df-simultaneous-substitution — Simultaneous Structural Substitution and Capture-Freeness","depends_on":["[[17-df-term]]","[[17-df-formula]]","[[17-df-atomic-formula]]","[[17-df-free-variable]]","[[17-df-symbol-alphabet]]","[[17-df-set-functions]]"],"label_origin":"local-descriptive","source_verification":"local reconstruction from supplied book-17 usage; not a transcription of missing upstream files"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-df-simultaneous-substitution"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-df-simultaneous-substitution</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-simultaneous-substitution — Simultaneous Structural Substitution and Capture-Freeness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c40994941c97c4da\" href=\"?note=c40994941c97c4da\" title=\"17-df-term\">17-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"465b5002eb16d1cf\" href=\"?note=465b5002eb16d1cf\" title=\"17-df-formula\">17-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b456e6677109f36b\" href=\"?note=b456e6677109f36b\" title=\"17-df-atomic-formula\">17-df-atomic-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"58507ea1921a657e\" href=\"?note=58507ea1921a657e\" title=\"17-df-free-variable\">17-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"058f3c1c00535492\" href=\"?note=058f3c1c00535492\" title=\"17-df-symbol-alphabet\">17-df-symbol-alphabet</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"571123944253d721\" href=\"?note=571123944253d721\" title=\"17-df-set-functions\">17-df-set-functions</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-descriptive"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"local reconstruction from supplied book-17 usage; not a transcription of missing upstream files"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L&#39;\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(L&#39;\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span>；项、公式、原子式及自由变量见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c40994941c97c4da\" href=\"?note=c40994941c97c4da\" title=\"17-df-term\">17-df-term</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"465b5002eb16d1cf\" href=\"?note=465b5002eb16d1cf\" title=\"17-df-formula\">17-df-formula</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b456e6677109f36b\" href=\"?note=b456e6677109f36b\" title=\"17-df-atomic-formula\">17-df-atomic-formula</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"58507ea1921a657e\" href=\"?note=58507ea1921a657e\" title=\"17-df-free-variable\">17-df-free-variable</a>。函数图、限制及值域见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"571123944253d721\" href=\"?note=571123944253d721\" title=\"17-df-set-functions\">17-df-set-functions</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{L&#39;}\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{L&#39;}\\)</span> 为等式分支的独立项输入，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{L&#39;}\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{L&#39;}\\)</span>。各应用子句局部取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\omega\">\\(k\\in\\omega\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{L&#39;}^k\">\\(\\bar t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{L&#39;}^k\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_i=\\bar t(i)\">\\(t_i=\\bar t(i)\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;k\">\\(i&lt;k\\)</span>）；函数子句取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_{L&#39;,k}\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_{L&#39;,k}\\)</span>，关系子句取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_{L&#39;,k}\">\\(R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_{L&#39;,k}\\)</span>。变量、常元与量词子句分别局部取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{L&#39;}\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{L&#39;}\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_{L&#39;}\">\\(c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_{L&#39;}\\)</span>，不假设各类符号同时存在。显示替换列表另取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar u\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{L&#39;}^k\">\\(\\bar u\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{L&#39;}^k\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall i,j&lt;k\\;(\\bar u(i)=\\bar u(j)\\to i=j)\">\\(\\forall i,j&lt;k\\;(\\bar u(i)=\\bar u(j)\\to i=j)\\)</span>，并记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u_i=\\bar u(i)\">\\(u_i=\\bar u(i)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Subst}_{L&#39;}\">\\(\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Subst}_{L&#39;}\\)</span>，该集合在下式定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{tm}}_{L&#39;}\">\\(\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{tm}}_{L&#39;}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{fm}}_{L&#39;}\">\\(\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{fm}}_{L&#39;}\\)</span> 分别是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Term}_{L&#39;}\\times\\mathrm{Subst}_{L&#39;}\\to\\mathrm{Term}_{L&#39;}\">\\(\\mathrm{Term}_{L&#39;}\\times\\mathrm{Subst}_{L&#39;}\\to\\mathrm{Term}_{L&#39;}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Form}_{L&#39;}\\times\\mathrm{Subst}_{L&#39;}\\to\\mathrm{Form}_{L&#39;}\">\\(\\mathrm{Form}_{L&#39;}\\times\\mathrm{Subst}_{L&#39;}\\to\\mathrm{Form}_{L&#39;}\\)</span> 的函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CaptureFree}_{L&#39;}\">\\(\\operatorname{CaptureFree}_{L&#39;}\\)</span> 是后一个输入域上的谓词；双括号只在该谓词成立时定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top\">\\(\\top\\)</span> 为元语言真命题；递归以有限字符串长度为良基。在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_i/u_i\">\\(t_i/u_i\\)</span> 中分母是变量符号，分子是项字符串；变量作为替换项时必须先作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{lit}\">\\(\\operatorname{lit}\\)</span> 提升，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"058f3c1c00535492\" href=\"?note=058f3c1c00535492\" title=\"17-df-symbol-alphabet\">17-df-symbol-alphabet</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Subst}_{L&#39;}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\theta\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{L&#39;}\\times\\mathrm{Term}_{L&#39;}:\n\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;\\exists u\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{L&#39;}^k\\;\n(\\theta:\\operatorname{ran}(u)\\to\\mathrm{Term}_{L&#39;})\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{tm}}_{L&#39;}(\\operatorname{lit}(x),\\theta)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\theta(x),&amp;x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\theta),\\\\\\operatorname{lit}(x),&amp;x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(\\theta),\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{tm}}_{L&#39;}(\\operatorname{lit}(c),\\theta)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{lit}(c),\\\\\n\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{tm}}_{L&#39;}(f(t_0,\\ldots,t_{k-1}),\\theta)\n&amp;\\coloneqq f(\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{tm}}_{L&#39;}(t_0,\\theta),\\ldots,\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{tm}}_{L&#39;}(t_{k-1},\\theta)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{fm}}_{L&#39;}(s=t,\\theta)\n&amp;\\coloneqq(\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{tm}}_{L&#39;}(s,\\theta)=\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{tm}}_{L&#39;}(t,\\theta)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{fm}}_{L&#39;}(R(t_0,\\ldots,t_{k-1}),\\theta)\n&amp;\\coloneqq R(\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{tm}}_{L&#39;}(t_0,\\theta),\\ldots,\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{tm}}_{L&#39;}(t_{k-1},\\theta)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{fm}}_{L&#39;}(\\neg\\alpha,\\theta)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{fm}}_{L&#39;}(\\alpha,\\theta),\\\\\n\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{fm}}_{L&#39;}(\\alpha\\to\\beta,\\theta)\n&amp;\\coloneqq(\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{fm}}_{L&#39;}(\\alpha,\\theta)\\to\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{fm}}_{L&#39;}(\\beta,\\theta)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{fm}}_{L&#39;}(\\forall x\\,\\alpha,\\theta)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall x\\,\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{fm}}_{L&#39;}(\\alpha,\\theta\\upharpoonright(\\mathrm{Var}_{L&#39;}\\setminus\\{x\\})),\\\\\n\\alpha[t_0/u_0,\\ldots,t_{k-1}/u_{k-1}]\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{fm}}_{L&#39;}(\\alpha,\\{(u_i,t_i):i&lt;k\\}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Subst}_{L&#39;}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\theta\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{L&#39;}\\times\\mathrm{Term}_{L&#39;}:\n\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;\\exists u\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{L&#39;}^k\\;\n(\\theta:\\operatorname{ran}(u)\\to\\mathrm{Term}_{L&#39;})\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{tm}}_{L&#39;}(\\operatorname{lit}(x),\\theta)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\theta(x),&amp;x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\theta),\\\\\\operatorname{lit}(x),&amp;x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(\\theta),\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{tm}}_{L&#39;}(\\operatorname{lit}(c),\\theta)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{lit}(c),\\\\\n\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{tm}}_{L&#39;}(f(t_0,\\ldots,t_{k-1}),\\theta)\n&amp;\\coloneqq f(\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{tm}}_{L&#39;}(t_0,\\theta),\\ldots,\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{tm}}_{L&#39;}(t_{k-1},\\theta)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{fm}}_{L&#39;}(s=t,\\theta)\n&amp;\\coloneqq(\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{tm}}_{L&#39;}(s,\\theta)=\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{tm}}_{L&#39;}(t,\\theta)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{fm}}_{L&#39;}(R(t_0,\\ldots,t_{k-1}),\\theta)\n&amp;\\coloneqq R(\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{tm}}_{L&#39;}(t_0,\\theta),\\ldots,\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{tm}}_{L&#39;}(t_{k-1},\\theta)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{fm}}_{L&#39;}(\\neg\\alpha,\\theta)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{fm}}_{L&#39;}(\\alpha,\\theta),\\\\\n\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{fm}}_{L&#39;}(\\alpha\\to\\beta,\\theta)\n&amp;\\coloneqq(\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{fm}}_{L&#39;}(\\alpha,\\theta)\\to\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{fm}}_{L&#39;}(\\beta,\\theta)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{fm}}_{L&#39;}(\\forall x\\,\\alpha,\\theta)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall x\\,\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{fm}}_{L&#39;}(\\alpha,\\theta\\upharpoonright(\\mathrm{Var}_{L&#39;}\\setminus\\{x\\})),\\\\\n\\alpha[t_0/u_0,\\ldots,t_{k-1}/u_{k-1}]\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{fm}}_{L&#39;}(\\alpha,\\{(u_i,t_i):i&lt;k\\}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{CaptureFree}_{L&#39;}(\\alpha,\\theta)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\top\n\\quad(\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{AtomForm}_{L&#39;}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{CaptureFree}_{L&#39;}(\\neg\\alpha,\\theta)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{CaptureFree}_{L&#39;}(\\alpha,\\theta),\\\\\n\\operatorname{CaptureFree}_{L&#39;}(\\alpha\\to\\beta,\\theta)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{CaptureFree}_{L&#39;}(\\alpha,\\theta)\\land\\operatorname{CaptureFree}_{L&#39;}(\\beta,\\theta),\\\\\n\\operatorname{CaptureFree}_{L&#39;}(\\forall x\\,\\alpha,\\theta)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{CaptureFree}_{L&#39;}(\\alpha,\\theta\\upharpoonright(\\mathrm{Var}_{L&#39;}\\setminus\\{x\\}))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall u\\in(\\operatorname{dom}(\\theta)\\setminus\\{x\\})\\cap\\mathrm{FreeVar}(\\alpha)\\;\n\\bigl(x\\notin\\mathrm{VarOcc}_{L&#39;}(\\theta(u))\\bigr),\\\\\n\\operatorname{CaptureFree}_{L&#39;}(\\alpha,\\theta)&amp;\\to\n\\alpha⟦\\theta⟧:=\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{fm}}_{L&#39;}(\\alpha,\\theta).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{CaptureFree}_{L&#39;}(\\alpha,\\theta)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\top\n\\quad(\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{AtomForm}_{L&#39;}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{CaptureFree}_{L&#39;}(\\neg\\alpha,\\theta)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{CaptureFree}_{L&#39;}(\\alpha,\\theta),\\\\\n\\operatorname{CaptureFree}_{L&#39;}(\\alpha\\to\\beta,\\theta)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{CaptureFree}_{L&#39;}(\\alpha,\\theta)\\land\\operatorname{CaptureFree}_{L&#39;}(\\beta,\\theta),\\\\\n\\operatorname{CaptureFree}_{L&#39;}(\\forall x\\,\\alpha,\\theta)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{CaptureFree}_{L&#39;}(\\alpha,\\theta\\upharpoonright(\\mathrm{Var}_{L&#39;}\\setminus\\{x\\}))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall u\\in(\\operatorname{dom}(\\theta)\\setminus\\{x\\})\\cap\\mathrm{FreeVar}(\\alpha)\\;\n\\bigl(x\\notin\\mathrm{VarOcc}_{L&#39;}(\\theta(u))\\bigr),\\\\\n\\operatorname{CaptureFree}_{L&#39;}(\\alpha,\\theta)&amp;\\to\n\\alpha⟦\\theta⟧:=\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{fm}}_{L&#39;}(\\alpha,\\theta).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留原输入实际使用的同时结构替换：进入量词时删除被绑定变量，替换项只插入一次，不再次替换。原始函数不会主动改名；“捕获自由”另以递归谓词定义，不能将它从任意输入的函数定义中默认推出。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"c40994941c97c4da","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"465b5002eb16d1cf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-atomic-formula","status":"resolved","id":"b456e6677109f36b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-atomic-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"58507ea1921a657e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"058f3c1c00535492","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-symbol-alphabet]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-set-functions","status":"resolved","id":"571123944253d721","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-set-functions]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"c40994941c97c4da","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L'\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$；项、公式、原子式及自由变量见 [[17-df-term]]、[[17-df-formula]]、[[17-df-atomic-formula]]、[[17-df-free-variable]]。函数图、限制及值域见 [[17-df-set-functions]]。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"465b5002eb16d1cf","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L'\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$；项、公式、原子式及自由变量见 [[17-df-term]]、[[17-df-formula]]、[[17-df-atomic-formula]]、[[17-df-free-variable]]。函数图、限制及值域见 [[17-df-set-functions]]。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-atomic-formula","status":"resolved","id":"b456e6677109f36b","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L'\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$；项、公式、原子式及自由变量见 [[17-df-term]]、[[17-df-formula]]、[[17-df-atomic-formula]]、[[17-df-free-variable]]。函数图、限制及值域见 [[17-df-set-functions]]。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"58507ea1921a657e","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L'\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$；项、公式、原子式及自由变量见 [[17-df-term]]、[[17-df-formula]]、[[17-df-atomic-formula]]、[[17-df-free-variable]]。函数图、限制及值域见 [[17-df-set-functions]]。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-set-functions","status":"resolved","id":"571123944253d721","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L'\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$；项、公式、原子式及自由变量见 [[17-df-term]]、[[17-df-formula]]、[[17-df-atomic-formula]]、[[17-df-free-variable]]。函数图、限制及值域见 [[17-df-set-functions]]。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"058f3c1c00535492","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Subst}_{L'}$，该集合在下式定义。$\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{tm}}_{L'}$、$\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{fm}}_{L'}$ 分别是 $\\mathrm{Term}_{L'}\\times\\mathrm{Subst}_{L'}\\to\\mathrm{Term}_{L'}$、$\\mathrm{Form}_{L'}\\times\\mathrm{Subst}_{L'}\\to\\mathrm{Form}_{L'}$ 的函数。$\\operatorname{CaptureFree}_{L'}$ 是后一个输入域上的谓词；双括号只在该谓词成立时定义。$\\top$ 为元语言真命题；递归以有限字符串长度为良基。在 $t_i/u_i$ 中分母是变量符号，分子是项字符串；变量作为替换项时必须先作 $\\operatorname{lit}$ 提升，见 [[17-df-symbol-alphabet]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L'\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}","display":false},{"tex":"s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{L'}","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{L'}","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{L'}^k","display":false},{"tex":"t_i=\\bar t(i)","display":false},{"tex":"i<k","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_{L',k}","display":false},{"tex":"R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_{L',k}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{L'}","display":false},{"tex":"c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_{L'}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar u\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{L'}^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall i,j<k\\;(\\bar u(i)=\\bar u(j)\\to i=j)","display":false},{"tex":"u_i=\\bar u(i)","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Subst}_{L'}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{tm}}_{L'}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{fm}}_{L'}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Term}_{L'}\\times\\mathrm{Subst}_{L'}\\to\\mathrm{Term}_{L'}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Form}_{L'}\\times\\mathrm{Subst}_{L'}\\to\\mathrm{Form}_{L'}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CaptureFree}_{L'}","display":false},{"tex":"\\top","display":false},{"tex":"t_i/u_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{lit}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Subst}_{L'}&\\coloneqq\n\\{\\theta\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{L'}\\times\\mathrm{Term}_{L'}:\n\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;\\exists u\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{L'}^k\\;\n(\\theta:\\operatorname{ran}(u)\\to\\mathrm{Term}_{L'})\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{tm}}_{L'}(\\operatorname{lit}(x),\\theta)\n&\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\theta(x),&x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\theta),\\\\\\operatorname{lit}(x),&x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(\\theta),\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{tm}}_{L'}(\\operatorname{lit}(c),\\theta)&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{lit}(c),\\\\\n\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{tm}}_{L'}(f(t_0,\\ldots,t_{k-1}),\\theta)\n&\\coloneqq f(\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{tm}}_{L'}(t_0,\\theta),\\ldots,\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{tm}}_{L'}(t_{k-1},\\theta)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{fm}}_{L'}(s=t,\\theta)\n&\\coloneqq(\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{tm}}_{L'}(s,\\theta)=\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{tm}}_{L'}(t,\\theta)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{fm}}_{L'}(R(t_0,\\ldots,t_{k-1}),\\theta)\n&\\coloneqq R(\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{tm}}_{L'}(t_0,\\theta),\\ldots,\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{tm}}_{L'}(t_{k-1},\\theta)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{fm}}_{L'}(\\neg\\alpha,\\theta)\n&\\coloneqq\\neg\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{fm}}_{L'}(\\alpha,\\theta),\\\\\n\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{fm}}_{L'}(\\alpha\\to\\beta,\\theta)\n&\\coloneqq(\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{fm}}_{L'}(\\alpha,\\theta)\\to\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{fm}}_{L'}(\\beta,\\theta)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{fm}}_{L'}(\\forall x\\,\\alpha,\\theta)\n&\\coloneqq\\forall x\\,\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{fm}}_{L'}(\\alpha,\\theta\\upharpoonright(\\mathrm{Var}_{L'}\\setminus\\{x\\})),\\\\\n\\alpha[t_0/u_0,\\ldots,t_{k-1}/u_{k-1}]\n&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{fm}}_{L'}(\\alpha,\\{(u_i,t_i):i<k\\}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{CaptureFree}_{L'}(\\alpha,\\theta)&\\leftrightarrow\\top\n\\quad(\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{AtomForm}_{L'}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{CaptureFree}_{L'}(\\neg\\alpha,\\theta)&\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{CaptureFree}_{L'}(\\alpha,\\theta),\\\\\n\\operatorname{CaptureFree}_{L'}(\\alpha\\to\\beta,\\theta)&\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{CaptureFree}_{L'}(\\alpha,\\theta)\\land\\operatorname{CaptureFree}_{L'}(\\beta,\\theta),\\\\\n\\operatorname{CaptureFree}_{L'}(\\forall x\\,\\alpha,\\theta)&\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{CaptureFree}_{L'}(\\alpha,\\theta\\upharpoonright(\\mathrm{Var}_{L'}\\setminus\\{x\\}))\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall u\\in(\\operatorname{dom}(\\theta)\\setminus\\{x\\})\\cap\\mathrm{FreeVar}(\\alpha)\\;\n\\bigl(x\\notin\\mathrm{VarOcc}_{L'}(\\theta(u))\\bigr),\\\\\n\\operatorname{CaptureFree}_{L'}(\\alpha,\\theta)&\\to\n\\alpha⟦\\theta⟧:=\\operatorname{sub}^{\\mathrm{fm}}_{L'}(\\alpha,\\theta).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":5058,"backlinks":[{"id":"fe3b669b17d273d8","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"同时结构替换及其捕获自由谓词采用 [[17-df-simultaneous-substitution]]；$\\mathrm{BV}_{L'}$ 采用 [[17-df-bound-variable]]。本模式在 $L'=L^{\\mathrm{Sk}}$ 中使用这些递归；变量出现在替换项位置时先使用 $\\operatorname{lit}$ 提升。"},{"id":"13c73c6f79ee78a7","anchor":"ref-91","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-df-simultaneous-substitution]]"},{"id":"2c98c9e634ff4b44","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[17-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-compactness]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-lowenheim-skolem]]\n[[17-df-algebraic-closure]]\n[[17-df-bound-variable]]\n[[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]\n[[17-df-isomorphism]]\n[[17-df-language-operations]]\n[[17-df-lindstrom-regularity]]\n[[17-df-linear-order]]\n[[17-df-ordinals-finiteness]]\n[[17-df-partial-isomorphism]]\n[[17-df-partition-relation]]\n[[17-df-set-functions]]\n[[17-df-simultaneous-substitution]]\n[[17-df-symbol-alphabet]]"}],"outgoing":["c40994941c97c4da","465b5002eb16d1cf","b456e6677109f36b","58507ea1921a657e","058f3c1c00535492","571123944253d721"]}